(106, 1, '2022-09-20 11:20:44', '2022-09-20 11:20:44', '<p class=\"text-justify\" style=\"color: #990000;\"><strong>NEWPORT BEACH JAIL</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">If a friend or loved one has been arrested and they are being held in the Newport Beach Jail, call us now for a free bail bond consultation. You’ll talk directly to one of our family members who, with years of experience and compassion, will get you the information you need to make the right decision on how secure their fast release. We’ll walk you through this procedure with as little stress and effort, as possible. Our bail agents are standing by to help you in all your bail bonds needs in Newport Beach</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Location and Driving Directions</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Newport Beach Police Department 870 Santa Barbara Drive, Newport Beach, CA</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\"><strong>Driving Directions (Google Map)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc-item\">\r\n 	<li><strong>Eastbound East Pacific Coast Highway</strong> Turn left onto Jamboree. Follow Jamboree to Santa Barbara Drive, turn right and then make an immediate left into the Newport Beach Police Department parking lot.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Westbound East Pacific Coast Highway</strong> Turn right onto Jamboree. Follow Jamboree to Santa Barbara Drive, turn right and then make an immediate left into the Newport Beach Police Department parking lot.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>From the 405 Freeway North</strong> Exit at Jamboree, turn left. Follow Jamboree to Santa Barbara Drive, turn left and then make an immediate left into the Newport Beach Police Department parking lot.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>From the 405 Freeway South</strong> Exit at Jamboree, turn right. Follow Jamboree to Santa Barbara Drive, turn left and then make an immediate left into the Newport Beach Police Department parking lot.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>From the 55 Freeway South</strong> Take the 55 Freeway to the 73 Freeway South. Exit at Jamboree and turn right. Follow Jamboree to Santa Barbara Drive, turn left and then make an immediate left into the Newport Beach Police Department parking lot.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>From the 55 Freeway North</strong> Take the 55 Freeway to the 73 Freeway South. Exit at Jamboree and turn right. Follow Jamboree to Santa Barbara Drive, turn left and then make an immediate left into the Newport Beach Police Department parking lot.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\" style=\"color: #ff6600;\"><strong>Bail Information for the Newport Beach Jail</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Subjects who are currently in custody at Newport Beach Police Department may be bailed out 24 hours a day, in person, at the Front Desk. Please contact the Jail at (949) 644-3672 for Bail Information. Or call Orange County Bail Bonds at 714-BAIL OUT.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>The following restrictions apply to Bail Payments:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc-item\">\r\n 	<li>We accept six types of payment for Bails: Cash, Checks, Bonds, Money Orders, Cashier\'s Checks, and Traveler\'s Checks.</li>\r\n 	<li>You may not combine methods of payment, one type of payment must be used for the entire Bail Amount.</li>\r\n 	<li>Checks, Money Orders, Cashier\'s Checks, and Traveler\'s Checks must be made out to the appropriate court for the exact amount of the Bail. If the arrestee has multiple warrants, there must be a separate check for each warrant.</li>\r\n 	<li>Checks have the following additional restrictions:\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc-item\">\r\n 	<li>We do not accept business checks</li>\r\n 	<li>We do not accept out-of-state checks</li>\r\n 	<li>We do not accept checks for Bails larger than $7,500.00</li>\r\n 	<li>We do not accept checks for Warrants issued by courts outside of Orange County</li>\r\n 	<li>We do not accept post dated checks</li>\r\n 	<li>We do not accept third party checks</li>\r\n 	<li>All checks must be personal checks, drawn on a local bank, and must be accompanied by a Valid Driver\'s License</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'bail bond agent newport beach jail information', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '103-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-09-20 11:20:44', '2022-09-20 11:20:44', '', 103, 'https://www.newport-beachbailbonds.com/?p=106', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
