;color: #4f4f4f;\"><em style=\"color: #0000cc; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 600;\">We\'ll meet you at the jail</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\" style=\";color: #4f4f4f;\"><strong>425 S Harbor Blvd</strong><strong>\r\nAnaheim, CA 92805\r\nToll Free: (800) 422-4540 | Toll Free: (888) BAIL-ALL\r\nTel: (714) 772-2045 </strong>\r\n<a class=\"d-block mb-3\" style=\"color: #0000cc; font-weight: 600;\" title=\"blocked::mailto:info@anaheimbail-bonds.com\" href=\"mailto:info@anaheimbail-bonds.com\">info@anaheimbail-bonds.com</a>\r\n<span class=\"\">*Conditions Apply</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-02 09:20:39', '2024-11-02 09:20:39', '', 5, 'https://www.anaheimbail-bonds.com/staging/?p=189', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
